    "claims": [
      "Development recipes hold input materials and production steps for an R&D item",
      "Development recipes can be used to improve or cheapen existing items",
      "R&D items have their own number series and a slimmed-down master data set",
      "R&D items can be bought and sold as samples using normal logistics and inventory",
      "Handles samples with both customers and suppliers",
      "Sample quality can be checked when combined with Yaveon 365 Quality Assurance",
      "A-to-B comparison shows differences between development recipes and production specifications",
      "Item features from Yaveon 365 Base can be viewed and edited during development",
      "Calculates feature values of a development product from its components",
      "Cost and price calculation for development products requires the Yaveon 365 Costing app",
      "Automatic documentation supports A/B comparisons of formulation levels across the product life cycle",
      "Requires BC Premium edition"
    ],
